{
 "0001": {
  "title": "",
  "nodes": [
   {
    "id": "h4_00001",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     11
    ],
    "text": "[A1][/A1]NAME",
    "placeholders": {
     "A1": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_516_01\" id=\"tag_17_516_01\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "blockquote_00002",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     13
    ],
    "text": "send — send a message on a socket",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00003",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[A2][/A2]SYNOPSIS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A2": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_516_02\" id=\"tag_17_516_02\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00004",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     17,
     1
    ],
    "text": "[CODE3]",
    "placeholders": {
     "CODE3": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<code><tt>#include &lt;<a href=\"../basedefs/sys_socket.h.html\">sys/socket.h</a>&gt;<br>\n<br>\nssize_t send(int</tt> <i>socket</i><tt>, const void *</tt><i>buffer</i><tt>, size_t</tt> <i>length</i><tt>, int</tt>\n<i>flags</i><tt>);<br></tt></code>"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00005",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[A4][/A4]DESCRIPTION",
    "placeholders": {
     "A4": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_516_03\" id=\"tag_17_516_03\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00006",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [I5]send[/I5]() function shall initiate transmission of a message from the specified socket to its peer. The [I6]send[/I6]()\nfunction shall send a message only when the socket is connected. If the socket is a connectionless-mode socket, the message shall\nbe sent to the pre-specified peer address.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I5": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I6": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00007",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The [I7]send[/I7]() function takes the following arguments:",
    "placeholders": {
     "I7": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00008",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     5,
     3
    ],
    "text": "[I8]socket[/I8]",
    "placeholders": {
     "I8": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00009",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     5,
     5
    ],
    "text": "Specifies the socket file descriptor.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00010",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     5,
     7
    ],
    "text": "[I9]buffer[/I9]",
    "placeholders": {
     "I9": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00011",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     5,
     9
    ],
    "text": "Points to the buffer containing the message to send.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00012",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     5,
     11
    ],
    "text": "[I10]length[/I10]",
    "placeholders": {
     "I10": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00013",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     5,
     13
    ],
    "text": "Specifies the length of the message in bytes.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00014",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     5,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[I11]flags[/I11]",
    "placeholders": {
     "I11": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00015",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     5,
     17
    ],
    "text": "Specifies the type of message transmission. Values of this argument are formed by logically OR'ing zero or more of the\nfollowing flags:\n\n\nMSG_EOR\nTerminates a record (if supported by the protocol).\nMSG_OOB\nSends out-of-band data on sockets that support out-of-band communications. The significance and semantics of out-of-band data\nare protocol-specific.\nMSG_NOSIGNAL\nRequests not to send the SIGPIPE signal if an attempt to send is made on a stream-oriented socket that is no longer connected.\nThe [EPIPE] error shall still be returned.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00016",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     7
    ],
    "text": "The length of the message to be sent is specified by the [I12]length[/I12] argument. If the message is too long to pass through the\nunderlying protocol, [I13]send[/I13]() shall fail and no data shall be transmitted.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I12": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I13": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00017",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     9
    ],
    "text": "Successful completion of a call to [I14]send[/I14]() does not guarantee delivery of the message. A return value of -1 indicates only\nlocally-detected errors.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I14": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00018",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     11
    ],
    "text": "If space is not available at the sending socket to hold the message to be transmitted, and the socket file descriptor does not\nhave O_NONBLOCK set, [I15]send[/I15]() shall block until space is available or a timeout occurs (see SO_SNDTIMEO in [A16][I17]2.10.16 Use of Options[/I17][/A16]). If space is not available at the sending socket to\nhold the message to be transmitted, and the socket file descriptor does have O_NONBLOCK set, [I18]send[/I18]() shall fail. The [A19][I20]select[/I20]()[/A19] and [A21][I22]poll[/I22]()[/A21] functions can be used to\ndetermine when it is possible to send more data.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I15": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A16": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/V2_chap02.html#tag_16_10_16\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I17": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I18": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A19": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/select.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I20": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A21": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/poll.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I22": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00019",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     13
    ],
    "text": "The socket in use may require the process to have appropriate privileges to use the [I23]send[/I23]() function.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I23": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00020",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     23
    ],
    "text": "[A24][/A24]RETURN VALUE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A24": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_516_04\" id=\"tag_17_516_04\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00021",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Upon successful completion, [I25]send[/I25]() shall return the number of bytes sent. Otherwise, -1 shall be returned and\n[I26]errno[/I26] set to indicate the error.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I25": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I26": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00022",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     27
    ],
    "text": "[A27][/A27]ERRORS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A27": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_516_05\" id=\"tag_17_516_05\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00023",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [I28]send[/I28]() function shall fail if:",
    "placeholders": {
     "I28": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00024",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     3
    ],
    "text": "[EAGAIN] or [EWOULDBLOCK]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00025",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     5
    ],
    "text": "The socket's file descriptor is marked O_NONBLOCK and the requested operation would block. See also SO_SNDTIMEO in [A29][I30]2.10.16 Use of Options[/I30][/A29].",
    "placeholders": {
     "A29": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/V2_chap02.html#tag_16_10_16\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I30": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00026",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     7
    ],
    "text": "[EBADF]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00027",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     9
    ],
    "text": "The [I31]socket[/I31] argument is not a valid file descriptor.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I31": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00028",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     11
    ],
    "text": "[ECONNRESET]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00029",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     13
    ],
    "text": "A connection was forcibly closed by a peer.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00030",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[EDESTADDRREQ]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00031",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     17
    ],
    "text": "The socket is not connection-mode and no peer address is set.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00032",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[EINTR]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00033",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     21
    ],
    "text": "A signal interrupted [I32]send[/I32]() before any data was transmitted.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I32": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00034",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     23
    ],
    "text": "[EMSGSIZE]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00035",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     25
    ],
    "text": "The message is too large to be sent all at once, as the socket requires.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00036",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     27
    ],
    "text": "[ENOTCONN]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00037",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     29
    ],
    "text": "The socket is not connected.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00038",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     31
    ],
    "text": "[ENOTSOCK]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00039",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     33
    ],
    "text": "The [I33]socket[/I33] argument does not refer to a socket.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I33": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00040",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     35
    ],
    "text": "[EOPNOTSUPP]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00041",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     37
    ],
    "text": "The [I34]socket[/I34] argument is associated with a socket that does not support one or more of the values set in\n[I35]flags[/I35].",
    "placeholders": {
     "I34": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I35": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00042",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     39
    ],
    "text": "[EPIPE]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00043",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     41
    ],
    "text": "The socket is shut down for writing, or the socket is connection-mode and is no longer connected. In the latter case, and if\nthe socket is of type SOCK_STREAM or SOCK_SEQPACKET and the MSG_NOSIGNAL flag is not set, the SIGPIPE signal is generated to the\ncalling thread.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00044",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     5
    ],
    "text": "The [I36]send[/I36]() function may fail if:",
    "placeholders": {
     "I36": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00045",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     3
    ],
    "text": "[EACCES]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00046",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     5
    ],
    "text": "The calling process does not have appropriate privileges.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00047",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     7
    ],
    "text": "[EIO]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00048",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     9
    ],
    "text": "An I/O error occurred while reading from or writing to the file system.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00049",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     11
    ],
    "text": "[ENETDOWN]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00050",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     13
    ],
    "text": "The local network interface used to reach the destination is down.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00051",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[ENETUNREACH]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00052",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     17
    ],
    "text": "No route to the network is present.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00053",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[ENOBUFS]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00054",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     21
    ],
    "text": "Insufficient resources were available in the system to perform the operation.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00055",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     35
    ],
    "text": "[A37][/A37]EXAMPLES",
    "placeholders": {
     "A37": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_516_06\" id=\"tag_17_516_06\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00056",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     37,
     1
    ],
    "text": "None.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00057",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     39
    ],
    "text": "[A38][/A38]APPLICATION USAGE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A38": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_516_07\" id=\"tag_17_516_07\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00058",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     41,
     1
    ],
    "text": "If the [I39]socket[/I39] argument refers to a connection-mode socket, the [I40]send[/I40]() function is equivalent to [A41][I42]sendto[/I42]()[/A41] (with any value for the [I43]dest_addr[/I43] and [I44]dest_len[/I44] arguments, as they are\nignored in this case). If the [I45]socket[/I45] argument refers to a socket and the [I46]flags[/I46] argument is 0, the [I47]send[/I47]()\nfunction is equivalent to [A48][I49]write[/I49]()[/A48].",
    "placeholders": {
     "I39": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I40": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A41": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/sendto.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
